<title>SOUTH AFRICA: York Timber withdraws cautionery.</title>
<headline>York Timber withdraws cautionery.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>York Timber said on Wednesday that negotiations referred to in a cautionery announcement in April had been terminated.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
